aw_text":"改走兵七进一更好！","text":"改走兵七进一更好！","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":19,"anchor_node_id":"0:19","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment22:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment22","raw_text":"冲卒着法积极！准备马7进5摆脱红炮的压迫，并可马5进3组织反攻。","text":"冲卒着法积极！准备马7进5摆脱红炮的压迫，并可马5进3组织反攻。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":22,"anchor_node_id":"0:22","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment23:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment23","raw_text":"冲兵着法强硬！准备利用大子活跃的优势与黑方一决雌雄，是力战的下法。||另有策略性的下法车一进一也不错，利用黑方右翼车马炮暂时受制的弱点，走车一平八加强牵制。","text":"冲兵着法强硬！准备利用大子活跃的优势与黑方一决雌雄，是力战的下法。\n另有策略性的下法车一进一也不错，利用黑方右翼车马炮暂时受制的弱点，走车一平八加强牵制。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":23,"anchor_node_id":"0:23","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment25:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment25","raw_text":"弃兵加快大子的出动，是前述作战方针的延续。","text":"弃兵加快大子的出动，是前述作战方针的延续。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":25,"anchor_node_id":"0:25","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment26:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment26","raw_text":"如马5进3，车七平八，炮8平3，马四进六，马2退1，车八进五，马3退2，车一进一，黑右翼子力壅塞不利。","text":"如马5进3，车七平八，炮8平3，马四进六，马2退1，车八进五，马3退2，车一进一，黑右翼子力壅塞不利。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":26,"anchor_node_id":"0:26","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment28:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment28","raw_text":"退炮打马帮忙，有引狼入室之感。应改走炮8平3，黑方大子占位不差，足可一战。","text":"退炮打马帮忙，有引狼入室之感。应改走炮8平3，黑方大子占位不差，足可一战。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":28,"anchor_node_id":"0:28","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment30:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment30","raw_text":"只好退炮，如卒5进1，车三进四，黑不行。","text":"只好退炮，如卒5进1，车三进四，黑不行。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":30,"anchor_node_id":"0:30","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment31:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment31","raw_text":"先弃后取精彩！","text":"先弃后取精彩！","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":31,"anchor_node_id":"0:31","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment34:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment34","raw_text":"平车吊炮先稳住阵脚，否则红车三平五黑阵立即崩溃。","text":"平车吊炮先稳住阵脚，否则红车三平五黑阵立即崩溃。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":34,"anchor_node_id":"0:34","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment35:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment35","raw_text":"退车底线不够严谨，应车三退一，||可防止后面车2平4再马2进4的入侵。","text":"退车底线不够严谨，应车三退一，\n可防止后面车2平4再马2进4的入侵。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":35,"anchor_node_id":"0:35","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment37:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment37","raw_text":"红方杀得性起，索性冲兵继续战斗。稳健些可走士四进五补棋，凭借多相之优徐图进取。","text":"红方杀得性起，索性冲兵继续战斗。稳健些可走士四进五补棋，凭借多相之优徐图进取。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":37,"anchor_node_id":"0:37","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment38:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment38","raw_text":"以当前的形势及黑方的棋风，进马作战自然是理所当然。","text":"以当前的形势及黑方的棋风，进马作战自然是理所当然。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":38,"anchor_node_id":"0:38","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment40:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment40","raw_text":"黑马踏八方，战斗进入高潮！","text":"黑马踏八方，战斗进入高潮！","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":40,"anchor_node_id":"0:40","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment44:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment44","raw_text":"弃车啃炮是漏算？还是不愿意走成车4进2，车三平二，车7进2，车二进五，车7平5，车二退四，这样的下风局面而冒险一击？这就无从知晓了。","text":"弃车啃炮是漏算？还是不愿意走成车4进2，车三平二，车7进2，车二进五，车7平5，车二退四，这样的下风局面而冒险一击？这就无从知晓了。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":44,"anchor_node_id":"0:44","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment47:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment47","raw_text":"补士大意！应改走车七平四，马6进4，帅五进一，红兵五进一太厉害，黑势不成气候。","text":"补士大意！应改走车七平四，马6进4，帅五进一，红兵五进一太厉害，黑势不成气候。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":47,"anchor_node_id":"0:47","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment48:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment48","raw_text":"回马金枪！红方肯定叫苦不迭。","text":"回马金枪！红方肯定叫苦不迭。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":48,"anchor_node_id":"0:48","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment49:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment49","raw_text":"红方在局势大优之际突然遭受重击，心理崩溃。否则此时改走车三平二吊住黑炮，马5进3，兵七进一，还有残局可下。","text":"红方在局势大优之际突然遭受重击，心理崩溃。否则此时改走车三平二吊住黑炮，马5进3，兵七进一，还有残局可下。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":49,"anchor_node_id":"0:49","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment52:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment52","raw_text":"黑胜","text":"黑胜","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":52,"anchor_node_id":"0:52","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_49:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_49","raw_text":"红方多兵多相占优。","text":"红方多兵多相占优。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":49,"anchor_node_id":"1:49","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_33:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_33","raw_text":"黑右翼子力壅塞不利。","text":"黑右翼子力壅塞不利。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":33,"anchor_node_id":"2:33","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["20 周德裕 先负 雷海山"],"DhtmlXQ_event":[""],"DhtmlXQ_date":[""],"DhtmlXQ_place":[""],"DhtmlXQ_round":[""],"DhtmlXQ_table":[""],"DhtmlXQ_red":["周德裕"],"DhtmlXQ_redteam":[""],"DhtmlXQ_redrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_black":["雷海山"],"DhtmlXQ_blackteam":[""],"DhtmlXQ_blackrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_result":["黑胜"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["E42 对兵互进右马局"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":["rsjy"],"DhtmlXQ_author":["rsjy"],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":44,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":3,"structured_branches":2,"line_statuses":{"legal":3},"source_move_records":66,"legal_move_records":66,"annotations":23,"annotation_s